title: AWS Application Load Balancer: Connections (v2)
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the rate of

 - active connections

 - new connections

 - rejected connections

 - TLS connections initiated by the client that did not establish a session

 for AWS/ApplicationELB services.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {{Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}}.

discovery:
 One service is created for each connection.
